# 0921 tokenize without holding the GIL (x14). Port of MiaAI-Lab patch 0099 (PR #108; merged in PR #131, 2026-10-10).
# Source: github.com/MiaAI-Lab/GLM-5.3-Flash-EXL3-2x-DGX-Sparks-TensorFold patches/0099.
# Our server routes chat prompts through Aevonix 0079 IncrementalTokenizer, so incremental.py gets encode_batch_fast
# (unsupported path) / encode_batch (tail, offsets still read); server.py gets App._encode_ids (Mia) at the prepare encode
# closure, _encode fallback, think-close and tool-gate sites; vision/glm.py as Mia.
# Same ids as encode (HF tokenizers batch calls run with the GIL released).

